   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "VERIFIED_UNBOUND\n(scenario: paid_not_active)\nSeen: Store confirmed Memories (web order).\nMissing or conflicting: Not on any camera.\nDecision: Connect it to this camera.\nAllowed: connect, then verify\nForbidden: selling the plan again (offer withheld)\nParent reads: \"We found your plan\u2026 There's nothing more to\npay.\"\nTests:\ntest_paid_not_active_connects_without_a_new_purchase, test_\nunconnected_purchase_withholds_the_offer_for_what_it_unlock\ns_only",
   "originalText": "VERIFIED_UNBOUND\n(scenario: paid_not_active)\nSeen: Store confirmed Memories (web order).\nMissing or conflicting: Not on any camera.\nDecision: Connect it to this camera.\nAllowed: connect, then verify\nForbidden: selling the plan again (offer withheld)\nParent reads: \"We found your plan\u2026 There's nothing more to\npay.\"\nTests:\ntest_paid_not_active_connects_without_a_new_purchase, test_\nunconnected_purchase_withholds_the_offer_for_what_it_unlock\ns_only",
