   "text": "ACTIVE_FEATURE_USABLE\n(scenario: renewal_reflected)\nSeen: Store renewal (version 2, new period).\nMissing or conflicting: None.\nDecision: Write the new period to the same camera.\nAllowed: verify\nForbidden: a second connect or purchase\nParent reads: \"Ready to use. Renewed \u00b7 runs to \u2026\"\nTests: test_renewal_of_a_connected_purchase_keeps_the_camer\na_active, test_a_renewal_delivered_twice_adds_one_period",
   "originalText": "ACTIVE_FEATURE_USABLE\n(scenario: renewal_reflected)\nSeen: Store renewal (version 2, new period).\nMissing or conflicting: None.\nDecision: Write the new period to the same camera.\nAllowed: verify\nForbidden: a second connect or purchase\nParent reads: \"Ready to use. Renewed \u00b7 runs to \u2026\"\nTests: test_renewal_of_a_connected_purchase_keeps_the_camer\na_active, test_a_renewal_delivered_twice_adds_one_period",
