   "text": "BILLING_GRACE\n(scenario: billing_grace)\nSeen: Store: renewal payment failed, grace to day 11.\nMissing or conflicting: Whether the retry succeeds.\nDecision: Keep access through the grace end.\nAllowed: check again\nForbidden: cutting access early; selling again\nParent reads: \"Your payment needs attention\u2026 stays on\nthrough Oct 21.\"\nTests: test_apple_grace_keeps_access_until_the_grace_end",
