   "text": "PLAN_EXPIRED\n(scenario: plan_ended)\nSeen: Last confirmed period ended 5 days ago.\nMissing or conflicting: No renewal from the store.\nDecision: Say it ended, and when. Wait for the store.\nAllowed: check again, contact support\nForbidden: a paywall on this screen; reconnecting the ended\npurchase (the feature page may offer a new plan: the period\nreally ended)\nParent reads: \"Memories on Nursery camera ended on Oct 6\u2026\"\nTests: test_renewal,\ntest_an_ended_purchase_cannot_be_connected",
   "originalText": "PLAN_EXPIRED\n(scenario: plan_ended)\nSeen: Last confirmed period ended 5 days ago.\nMissing or conflicting: No renewal from the store.\nDecision: Say it ended, and when. Wait for the store.\nAllowed: check again, contact support\nForbidden: a paywall on this screen; reconnecting the ended\npurchase (the feature page may offer a new plan: the period\nreally ended)\nParent reads: \"Memories on Nursery camera ended on Oct 6\u2026\"\nTests: test_renewal,\ntest_an_ended_purchase_cannot_be_connected",
