   "text": "ACTIVE_HARDWARE_BLOCKED\n(scenario: incompatible_hardware)\nSeen: Plan active; camera on a Flex Stand.\nMissing or conflicting: None: the mount is the limit.\nDecision: Explain the mount requirement.\nAllowed: mount guide, verify\nForbidden: offering a plan for a hardware problem\nParent reads: \"\u2026A different plan wouldn't change this.\"\nTests:\ntest_active_plan_on_wrong_mount_is_not_a_billing_problem",
   "originalText": "ACTIVE_HARDWARE_BLOCKED\n(scenario: incompatible_hardware)\nSeen: Plan active; camera on a Flex Stand.\nMissing or conflicting: None: the mount is the limit.\nDecision: Explain the mount requirement.\nAllowed: mount guide, verify\nForbidden: offering a plan for a hardware problem\nParent reads: \"\u2026A different plan wouldn't change this.\"\nTests:\ntest_active_plan_on_wrong_mount_is_not_a_billing_problem",
