   "text": "PURCHASE_PENDING\n(scenario: purchase_uncertain)\nSeen: Google Play: pending.\nMissing or conflicting: Final store answer.\nDecision: Wait; don't guess.\nAllowed: check again\nForbidden: granting access; selling again\nParent reads: \"Waiting for the store to confirm\u2026 nothing\nmore to buy.\"\nTests:\ntest_pending_evidence_waits_and_never_offers_a_purchase",
   "originalText": "PURCHASE_PENDING\n(scenario: purchase_uncertain)\nSeen: Google Play: pending.\nMissing or conflicting: Final store answer.\nDecision: Wait; don't guess.\nAllowed: check again\nForbidden: granting access; selling again\nParent reads: \"Waiting for the store to confirm\u2026 nothing\nmore to buy.\"\nTests:\ntest_pending_evidence_waits_and_never_offers_a_purchase",
