   "text": "ALREADY_ASSIGNED\n(scenario: paid_wrong_camera)\nSeen: Code redeemed on the Playroom camera.\nMissing or conflicting: Which camera was intended.\nDecision: Keep it where it is; support can move it.\nAllowed: contact support\nForbidden: moving a plan between cameras automatically\nParent reads: \"This plan is on another camera.\"\nTests: test_purchase_bound_to_another_camera_is_not_moved",
   "originalText": "ALREADY_ASSIGNED\n(scenario: paid_wrong_camera)\nSeen: Code redeemed on the Playroom camera.\nMissing or conflicting: Which camera was intended.\nDecision: Keep it where it is; support can move it.\nAllowed: contact support\nForbidden: moving a plan between cameras automatically\nParent reads: \"This plan is on another camera.\"\nTests: test_purchase_bound_to_another_camera_is_not_moved",
