   "text": "REFUNDED_OR_REVOKED\n(scenario: access_lost_after_refund)\nSeen: Refund at a newer store version.\nMissing or conflicting: None: the refund supersedes.\nDecision: Revoke through the claim history; keep the\nhistory.\nAllowed: contact support\nForbidden: honouring the older confirmation\nParent reads: \"This plan was refunded\u2026 Your history is\nkept.\"\nTests: test_refund_after_activation_revokes_access_and_keep\ns_history, test_refund_before_verification",
   "originalText": "REFUNDED_OR_REVOKED\n(scenario: access_lost_after_refund)\nSeen: Refund at a newer store version.\nMissing or conflicting: None: the refund supersedes.\nDecision: Revoke through the claim history; keep the\nhistory.\nAllowed: contact support\nForbidden: honouring the older confirmation\nParent reads: \"This plan was refunded\u2026 Your history is\nkept.\"\nTests: test_refund_after_activation_revokes_access_and_keep\ns_history, test_refund_before_verification",
