   "locked": false,
   "text": "BILLING_RETRY\n(scenario: billing_retry)\nSeen: Google: account hold.\nMissing or conflicting: Recovery.\nDecision: No access; keep the purchase on its camera.\nAllowed: check again, contact support\nForbidden: granting access; reconnect; resale\nParent reads: \"Your renewal payment didn't go through\u2026\nnothing more to buy.\"\nTests: test_billing_retry_without_grace_removes_access_but_\nkeeps_the_camera, test_a_plan_whose_payment_is_retrying_or_\npaused_is_never_sold_again",
   "originalText": "BILLING_RETRY\n(scenario: billing_retry)\nSeen: Google: account hold.\nMissing or conflicting: Recovery.\nDecision: No access; keep the purchase on its camera.\nAllowed: check again, contact support\nForbidden: granting access; reconnect; resale\nParent reads: \"Your renewal payment didn't go through\u2026\nnothing more to buy.\"\nTests: test_billing_retry_without_grace_removes_access_but_\nkeeps_the_camera, test_a_plan_whose_payment_is_retrying_or_\npaused_is_never_sold_again",
