   "text": "CONFLICTING_EVIDENCE\n(tested case)\nSeen: Two answers at the same store version, or a\ncontradiction after connect.\nMissing or conflicting: Which answer is true.\nDecision: Don't guess; show the conflict above 'checking'.\nAllowed: contact support\nForbidden: connecting it; hiding it behind 'checking'\nParent reads: \"We got two different answers.\"\nTests: test_same_version_contradiction_is_conflicting_and_c\nannot_be_connected, test_a_store_contradiction_after_connec\nt_is_not_hidden_behind_checking",
   "originalText": "CONFLICTING_EVIDENCE\n(tested case)\nSeen: Two answers at the same store version, or a\ncontradiction after connect.\nMissing or conflicting: Which answer is true.\nDecision: Don't guess; show the conflict above 'checking'.\nAllowed: contact support\nForbidden: connecting it; hiding it behind 'checking'\nParent reads: \"We got two different answers.\"\nTests: test_same_version_contradiction_is_conflicting_and_c\nannot_be_connected, test_a_store_contradiction_after_connec\nt_is_not_hidden_behind_checking",
