   "text": "409 PURCHASE_OWNED_ELSEWHERE\n(tested case)\nSeen: The purchase is owned by another household.\nMissing or conflicting: None.\nDecision: Refuse; reveal nothing.\nAllowed: none\nForbidden: binding it to this family's camera\nParent reads: \"We couldn't find this purchase on your\naccount.\"\nTests: test_cross_household_purchase_ownership,\ntest_another_familys_purchase_cannot_be_recorded_or_seen",
   "originalText": "409 PURCHASE_OWNED_ELSEWHERE\n(tested case)\nSeen: The purchase is owned by another household.\nMissing or conflicting: None.\nDecision: Refuse; reveal nothing.\nAllowed: none\nForbidden: binding it to this family's camera\nParent reads: \"We couldn't find this purchase on your\naccount.\"\nTests: test_cross_household_purchase_ownership,\ntest_another_familys_purchase_cannot_be_recorded_or_seen",
